WEBVTT

00:07:59.808 --> 00:08:03.395
The four building blocks
that make up messenger RNAs

00:08:03.395 --> 00:08:05.773
form what is known as the genetic code.

00:08:07.483 --> 00:08:09.026
As their name implies,

00:08:09.026 --> 00:08:11.946
messenger RNAs carry messages:

00:08:11.946 --> 00:08:16.867
messages that are translated by your body
in order to create proteins.

00:08:18.994 --> 00:08:23.457
Thus messenger RNAs
are the language of life.

00:08:24.833 --> 00:08:27.586
And the human body has a lot to say.

00:08:29.046 --> 00:08:32.091
So, like proteins,